  "content": "<!-- wp:ds-blocks/dst-wrapper {\"dsContainer\":\"\",\"dsContainerSideGap\":false,\"dsPadding\":{\"top\":{\"type\":\"default\",\"desktop\":\"\",\"mobile\":\"\"},\"bottom\":{\"type\":\"default\",\"desktop\":\"\",\"mobile\":\"\"}},\"metadata\":{\"categories\":[\"layout\"],\"patternName\":\"core/block/619\",\"name\":\"SBS FAQ p3 v4\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion {\"dsContainerSideGap\":false,\"separator\":true,\"showQuestionIcons\":true,\"questionIconSize\":\"3rem\",\"variant\":\"with-media\",\"columnsOrder\":\"order-reverse\",\"columnsGap\":\"6rem\",\"questionTypography\":{\"preset\":\"h4-style\",\"tag\":\"h3\"},\"media\":{\"style\":{\"desktop\":{\"mediaRatio\":\"3x4\",\"mediaFit\":\"cover\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5}},\"mobile\":{\"mediaRatio\":\"16x9\",\"mediaFit\":\"cover\",\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5}}},\"lazyLoad\":true,\"primaryType\":\"image\",\"videoExternal\":{\"html\":\"\"},\"imagePrimary\":{\"id\":2738,\"url\":\"https://dst.dsstaging1.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/narrow-street-tall-buildings.jpg\",\"alt\":\"\",\"mimeType\":\"\",\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"sizes\":{\"thumbnail\":{\"height\":150,\"width\":150,\"url\":\"https://dst.dsstaging1.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/narrow-street-tall-buildings-150x150.jpg\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"medium\":{\"height\":300,\"width\":200,\"url\":\"https://dst.dsstaging1.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/narrow-street-tall-buildings-200x300.jpg\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"full\":{\"url\":\"https://dst.dsstaging1.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/narrow-street-tall-buildings.jpg\",\"height\":1000,\"width\":665,\"orientation\":\"portrait\"}},\"size\":\"full\"}},\"mediaRatioDesktop\":\"3x4\",\"questionStyles\":{\"padding\":\"2rem 2rem 2rem 0rem\"},\"answerStyles\":{\"padding\":\"2rem 2rem 2rem 0rem\"},\"answerTypography\":{\"preset\":\"default\",\"fontSize\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dbase-text-size)\",\"fontSizeMobile\":\"11px\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.6\"},\"separatorBorder\":{\"color\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dsecondary-color2)\"},\"showHeader\":true} -->\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-heading {\"dsContainer\":\"\",\"dsContainerSideGap\":false,\"pretitle\":\"SBS FAQ p3 v4\",\"title\":\"FAQ\",\"subtitle\":\"u003cbru003eLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse varius enim in eros elementum tristique.\",\"showPretitle\":true,\"showSubtitle\":true,\"pretitleTypography\":{\"preset\":\"default\",\"fontFamily\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-ff)\",\"fontSize\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-fs)\",\"fontSizeMobile\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-fsM)\",\"lineHeight\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-lh)\",\"letterSpacing\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-ls)\",\"fontWeight\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-fw)\",\"textTransform\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-tt)\",\"color\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dpretitle-color)\"},\"titleTypography\":{\"preset\":\"h2-style\",\"fontFamily\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-ff)\",\"fontSize\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-fs)\",\"fontSizeMobile\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-fsM)\",\"lineHeight\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-lh)\",\"letterSpacing\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-ls)\",\"fontWeight\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-fw)\",\"textTransform\":\"var(u002du002ddstu002du002dh2-tt)\"},\"subtitleTypography\":{\"preset\":\"default\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.6\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item {\"title\":\"Adding Legal Legitimacy to Your Business\",\"defaultOpen\":true,\"questionIcon\":\"lib-icon-pin\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>U.S. Government – A patent is a U.S. Government sanctioned Exclusive right to operate in a market space which can be obtained and enforced internationally through PCT process.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item {\"title\":\"Investor and Customer Confidence\",\"questionIcon\":\"lib-icon-mail\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Patents add surety to the business itself, and to the exclusive market space the business owns the rights to and is actively investing in providing long-term protection, defensibility, and measurable enterprise value.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item {\"title\":\"Acquisition and Partnership Value\",\"questionIcon\":\"lib-icon-calendar\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Patents add surety of the business they are acquiring/partnering with, and the exclusive market space value they are acquiring or partnering with and planning for future business projections</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item {\"title\":\"Revenue Generation u0026amp; Cost Protection\",\"questionIcon\":\"lib-icon-clock\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are innovating in a technology area that touches any market area in which a lot of financial investment and innovation is occurring, it is in your own best interests to invest in patents as both a revenue generation, and expense protection device.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion-item -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/c-accordion -->\n<!-- /wp:ds-blocks/dst-wrapper -->",
  "syncStatus": "unsynced"
}